{"reviews":[{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-0","r":5.0,"t":"Just as described, perfect.","x":"I have read other reviews about this product. No it is not really large, but is not so small that it makes it not functional.  For myself it is a perfect size as to not take up a large area of space like the older plastic containers used to be. I also read people saying that it was to small to leave the puff and divider inside. I did not see this to be correct unless your trying to fill the container with to much powder. I was able to put enough powder for more than a week or two of use. I don't","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-1","r":4.0,"t":"Big and beautiful","x":"Love the design and size (3\"w x 3h\")!! Really disappointed that the puff has to sit directly in the powder. I thought it fit in the top with the divider... It doesn't. If you yank the lid off the divider will pull out and powder will get everywhere.. Be gentle.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-2","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!!","x":"This little container is perfect for my body powder! Perfect, perfect, perfect.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-3","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty, and helpful for baby, but design is a little flawed.","x":"I bought this because I needed something to keep my cornstarch powder in, for my chunky baby (cornstarch is better than baby powder!! But difficult to use straight from the box lol). Anyway, it works fine, and it'll do, but I feel like it isn't designed to have the powder, the pouf, and the interior lid inside all at the same time. Ideally, id like the pouf to sit on top of the interior lid, rather than directly in the powder. To the person in charge of designing this: it's an easy fix. You can ","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-4","r":4.0,"t":"Love it","x":"Love it.  I keep my monkey butt powder in it.  One for my purse  and one for my restroom.  It's apart of my female PH balancing kit.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-5","r":4.0,"t":"Perfect for my body powder","x":"This container is perfect for my body powder. The only thing I wish is that the pouf would fit in the container on top of the interior gold metal lid so that I can close the larger lid over it and keep my pouf with it. Right now since it's just on my counter, I keep the gold top as the lid covering the powder and the white top flipped upside down so I can set my pouf inside of it without it getting over powdered. Don't know what I will do with it when I travel for the summer though..","h":5,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-6","r":2.0,"t":"Meh..","x":"Product arrived fine.  Lid is difficult to remove so have left it completely off. Smaller than I imagined; measure out the size to see if you want something that small.  It's fine for a little girl but, think I will find another container with a larger area and larger puff.  Overall, the product is fine for what it is.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-7","r":5.0,"t":"Good size","x":"[[VIDEOID:7a500db83bd95512e53e4631fcece5fd]] It\u2019s a really good size,  not too big, not too small.  Im not sure if I would travel with it, I feel like it would spill. My only wish is that it came with like, a crate or something to be able to shake off excess powder, but all in all. It\u2019s definitely worth the money.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-8","r":3.0,"t":"The puff doesn't fit in the separate compartmentment","x":"I had to store the puff in the lower powder compartment and it makes half the container unusable. I was hopeful it would all fit.  It is still a very cute container and it holds some product, but I'd like if I could put more.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-9","r":5.0,"t":"Brilliant item!","x":"I really enjoyed using this item every day. I have gotten good compliments on the item and it has a lovely aesthetic appearance. I have also used this to travel and it saves me trouble of taking an entire bottle with me. I will consider getting this as a gift to family members.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-10","r":5.0,"t":"This is perfect!","x":"I just needed something to hold powder that came with it's own puff, but this container is so much nicer than I expected. It seems larger than 3\" and the color/design is beautiful. I'm going to order more to hold the little items on my dresser. : )","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-11","r":4.0,"t":"Makes a great gift","x":"These are well made and really cute.  Makes a nice gift when you add a canister of powder in the package with it.  I gave several of them for Christmas gifts and everyone seemed pleased.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-12","r":1.0,"t":"Body puff and container","x":"[[VIDEOID:cbce9fdb73cdbb3d93c04fafb065bfa]] Some type of stain or scratch on it and it is not well made. It is difficult to close without pressure buildup.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-13","r":1.0,"t":"Aluminum","x":"The description should\u2019ve said that it\u2019s made from aluminum. It\u2019s junk. It\u2019s not even as sturdy as the tea cans you get in the grocery store.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-14","r":5.0,"t":"Powder your privates","x":"My girlfriend bought this for her. But little does she know I power my fat thighs, butt, and nugs to prevent fat sweat rash.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-15","r":5.0,"t":"It's very cute and handy","x":"It's cute.. looks good on my dresser.. does what it's supposed to","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-16","r":5.0,"t":"Very Pretty","x":"It is nice to use haven't had one in years.  Would recommend.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-17","r":5.0,"t":"Makes applying powder east.","x":"I love this puff. It makes applying powder neater and easier.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-18","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful Little Powder Canister","x":"This item is beautiful.  I got one for myself and one for my mom and the quality is fantastic, the print is gorgeous, and I'm just over all very happy with this product.  It has a little lid inside to keep the powder from puffing up at you when you open it, and I appreciate that SO MUCH.  Definitely a great buy!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-19","r":5.0,"t":"Very Pleased","x":"This body powder case is everything I wanted. Quality is good, holds a lot of powder if I leave off the inside cover out, will only need that for travel.  Looks. pretty. My only doubt is about the quality of the puff, don\u2019t know how long it will last, but I\u2019ll see \u2026 i","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-20","r":3.0,"t":"Not easy","x":"I bought this for my setting powder.  It's not easy to open and every time I close it a burst of air shoots out the powder wasting product.  SMH","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-21","r":3.0,"t":"Pretty\u2026but","x":"It\u2019s a pretty container but the powder puff is so large for the container that it\u2019s impossibly not to get powder all over when taking it out.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-22","r":4.0,"t":"Very pretty but","x":"It\u2019s very pretty container but it\u2019s hard to open and close because of the air that seems to get trapped inside. Still love it tho.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-23","r":4.0,"t":"Nice but hard to open","x":"This is a very nice powder but it is incredibly difficult to open, anyone with dexterity issues probably couldn\u2019t use this.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B099ZBLX3Z-24","r":4.0,"t":"Color not as pictured","x":"Color is a lot brighter than pictured.  Also the puff doesn't fit in the top part so it will have to sit in the powder.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the container's size perfect\u2014not too big, not too small\u2014and praise its attractive design.","cites":[1,2,3,8,10,11]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the puff does not fit in the separate top compartment, forcing it to sit directly in the powder.","cites":[2,4,6,9]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the container is smaller than expected or too small for their needs.","cites":[1,7,9]},{"text":"Some reviewers report quality and durability issues, including flimsy construction, difficult lids, and stains or scratches.","cites":[7,13,14]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently mention using it for body powder and note it makes a nice gift.","cites":[3,5,10,12,15]}]},"qa":[]}